040000             0001   ; FSIM terrain-fixture launcher.
040000             0002   ;
040000             0003   ; This MOSlet remains resident at 0x0B0000 while each ordinary ADL fixture is
040000             0004   ; loaded at, and called through, its public MOS entry at 0x040000.  Every
040000             0005   ; fixture therefore uses the same final RET both under this launcher and when
040000             0006   ; LOAD/RUN directly from MOS.
